{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block title %}How It Works | Armadillo Tile and Home Repair{% endblock %}
{% block description %}See how to get started with Armadillo Tile: share the project, get honest options and pricing, then schedule the work.{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<section class="page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">A Straightforward Process</p>
  <h1>Good Work Starts With A Conversation</h1>
  <p>No pressure and no guesswork. Tell us what you need, get clear options, and decide what works for your home.</p>
</section>

<section class="card-grid" aria-label="How the project process works">
  <article class="content-card">
    <span class="step-number">01</span>
    <p class="card-label">Tell Us About It</p>
    <h2>Share The Project</h2>
    <p>Call, text, or send a quote request with a few details. Photos are helpful for understanding the work and discussing next steps.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="content-card">
    <span class="step-number">02</span>
    <p class="card-label">Get A Clear Plan</p>
    <h2>Talk Through Options</h2>
    <p>We will discuss the job, answer your questions, and provide honest options and pricing before work begins.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="content-card">
    <span class="step-number">03</span>
    <p class="card-label">Schedule The Work</p>
    <h2>Get It Done Right</h2>
    <p>When you are ready, we will arrange a time for the work and keep the job site neat while the project is underway.</p>
  </article>
</section>

<div class="action-row">
  <a class="button-link" href="/contact/">Tell Us About Your Project</a>
  <a class="button-link button-link-secondary" href="/services/">Explore Services</a>
</div>
{% endblock %}
